  "id": "grammar.c1.30.03.adv-counter-isolation-adversatives",
  "title": "Recap: Contrast and Balanced Views",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How it works",
      "content": "You know *egyrészt … másrészt* from B1 Unit 4, *ezzel szemben* and *viszont* from B1 Unit 11, *szerint* for a view from B1 Unit 13, *mindazonáltal* from B2 Unit 16 and *egyfelől … másfelől* from C1 Unit 1. The question of shared sovereignty is disputed: a good text gives each view with its own *szerint*. New in this lesson is the vocabulary of the debate."
